    center = (p + z^2/(2n)) / (1 + z^2/n)
    half   = z/(1 + z^2/n) * sqrt(p(1-p)/n + z^2/(4n^2))
  - For Agresti-Coull:
    n_tilde = n + z^2; p_tilde = (x + z^2/2)/n_tilde; half = z*sqrt(p_tilde(1-p_tilde)/n_tilde)
